[01:28.60] Midnight our sons and daughters
[01:32.97] Were cut down and taken from us
[01:36.83] Hear their heartbeats
[01:41.20] We hear their heartbeats
[01:47.07] In the wind we hear their laughter
[01:51.75] In the rain we see their tears
[01:55.32] Hear their heartbeats we hear their heartbeats
