[03:01.40] Night hangs like a prisoner
[03:05.65] Stretched over black and blue
[03:09.31] Hear their heartbeats
[03:13.77] We hear their heartbeats
[03:19.71] In the trees our sons stand naked
[03:24.36] Through the walls our daughters cry
[03:27.68] See their tears in the rainfall
